ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (content.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    fail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 超过 300 行，请拆分为更小的模块`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[PR 触发 Danger.js] --&gt; B[读取 PR 元数据]&#10;    B --&gt; C[检查文件变更]&#10;    B --&gt; D[检查提交消息]&#10;    B --&gt; E[检查 PR 大小]&#10;    C --&gt; F{规则匹配?}&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|匹配| G[在 PR 中留评论]&#10;    F --&gt;|不匹配| H[通过]\">flowchart TD\n    A[PR 触发 Danger.js] --&gt; B[读取 PR 元数据]\n    B --&gt; C[检查文件变更]\n    B --&gt; D[检查提交消息]\n    B --&gt; E[检查 PR 大小]\n    C --&gt; F{规则匹配?}\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|匹配| G[在 PR 中留评论]\n    F --&gt;|不匹配| H[通过]</pre><p><strong>GitHub Actions Bot 评论</strong>：直接在 Actions 中生成 PR 评论：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Comment PR with lint results&#10;  if: failure()&#10;  uses: actions/github-script@v7&#10;  with:&#10;    script: |&#10;      const body = `### Lint Check Failed&#10;      Please run \\`npm run lint:fix\\` to fix the issues.`;&#10;      await github.rest.issues.createComment({&#10;        owner: context.repo.owner,&#10;        repo: context.repo.repo,&#10;        issue_number: context.issue.number,&#10;        body,&#10;      });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Comment PR with lint results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">failure()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/github-script@v7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      const body = `### Lint Check Failed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      Please run \\`npm run lint:fix\\` to fix the issues.`;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      await github.rest.issues.createComment({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        owner: context.repo.owner,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        repo: context.repo.repo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        issue_number: context.issue.number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自动修复与-bot-提交\">自动修复与 Bot 提交</h2><p>一种更激进的自动化策略是让 CI 自动修复格式问题并提交到 PR 分支。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Auto Fix&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    types: [opened, synchronize]&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: write&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  auto-fix:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          ref: ${{ github.head_ref }}&#10;          token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 22&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm biome check --write .&#10;&#10;      - name: Commit fixes&#10;        run: |&#10;          git config user.name &quot;github-actions[bot]&quot;&#10;          git config user.email &quot;github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com&quot;&#10;          git add -A&#10;          git diff --staged --quiet || git commit -m &quot;style: auto-fix formatting&quot;&#10;          git push\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Auto Fix</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    types</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opened</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">synchronize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  auto-fix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.head_ref }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm biome check --write .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Commit fixes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git config user.name \"github-actions[bot]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git config user.email \"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git add -A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git diff --staged --quiet || git commit -m \"style: auto-fix formatting\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          git push</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅报告</td>\n<td>开发者保持控制</td>\n<td>需要手动修复</td>\n<td>严格的代码所有权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动修复 + 提交</td>\n<td>零摩擦</td>\n<td>可能覆盖有意的格式</td>\n<td>格式化问题为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suggestion 评论</td>\n<td>给出具体建议</td>\n<td>需要手动应用</td>\n<td>代码改进建议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自动修复的风险控制：只让 Bot 处理<strong>确定安全的修复</strong>（格式化、导入排序），不处理可能改变语义的修复（ESLint autofix 中的 suggestion 类型）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码质量仪表盘\">代码质量仪表盘</h2><p>长期追踪代码质量趋势有助于发现退化和指导改进方向。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface QualityMetrics {&#10;  lintWarnings: number;&#10;  lintErrors: number;&#10;  typeErrors: number;&#10;  testCoverage: number;&#10;  codeComplexity: number;&#10;  duplicateCode: number;&#10;  techDebt: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QualityMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lintWarnings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lintErrors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  typeErrors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  testCoverage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  codeComplexity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  duplicateCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  techDebt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过 CI 收集指标并输出为结构化数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Collect quality metrics&#10;  run: |&#10;    LINT_WARNINGS=$(eslint . --format json | jq &#39;[.[].warningCount] | add&#39;)&#10;    LINT_ERRORS=$(eslint . --format json | jq &#39;[.[].errorCount] | add&#39;)&#10;    COVERAGE=$(npx vitest --coverage --reporter=json | jq &#39;.total.lines.pct&#39;)&#10;    echo &quot;lint_warnings=$LINT_WARNINGS&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;    echo &quot;lint_errors=$LINT_ERRORS&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT&#10;    echo &quot;coverage=$COVERAGE&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Collect quality metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LINT_WARNINGS=$(eslint . --format json | jq '[.[].warningCount] | add')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    LINT_ERRORS=$(eslint . --format json | jq '[.[].errorCount] | add')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    COVERAGE=$(npx vitest --coverage --reporter=json | jq '.total.lines.pct')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"lint_warnings=$LINT_WARNINGS\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"lint_errors=$LINT_ERRORS\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    echo \"coverage=$COVERAGE\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>收集方式</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Lint errors</td>\n<td>eslint --format json</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>必须为零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lint warnings</td>\n<td>eslint --format json</td>\n<td>&lt;50</td>\n<td>逐步减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型错误</td>\n<td>tsc --noEmit</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>必须为零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试覆盖率</td>\n<td>vitest --coverage</td>\n<td>&gt;80%</td>\n<td>逐步提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件大小</td>\n<td>自定义脚本</td>\n<td>&lt;300 行</td>\n<td>保持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[每次 CI 运行] --&gt; B[收集指标]&#10;    B --&gt; C[存储到数据库/文件]&#10;    C --&gt; D[生成趋势图表]&#10;    D --&gt; E[PR 评论展示]&#10;    D --&gt; F[团队仪表盘]&#10;    F --&gt; G[周报/月报]\">flowchart LR\n    A[每次 CI 运行] --&gt; B[收集指标]\n    B --&gt; C[存储到数据库/文件]\n    C --&gt; D[生成趋势图表]\n    D --&gt; E[PR 评论展示]\n    D --&gt; F[团队仪表盘]\n    F --&gt; G[周报/月报]</pre><h2 id=\"审查流程最佳实践\">审查流程最佳实践</h2><p>一个高效的代码审查流程应该将自动化检查和人工审查有机结合。</p>\n<p><strong>Pre-merge 检查清单</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const preMergeChecklist = {&#10;  automated: [&#39;格式化检查通过&#39;, &#39;Lint 检查通过（zero warnings）&#39;, &#39;类型检查通过&#39;, &#39;单元测试通过&#39;, &#39;覆盖率未下降&#39;],&#10;  manual: [&#39;至少一位 reviewer approve&#39;, &#39;架构变更经过设计讨论&#39;, &#39;文档已更新（如需要）&#39;, &#39;变更描述清晰&#39;],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> preMergeChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  automated: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'格式化检查通过'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Lint 检查通过（zero warnings）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'类型检查通过'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'单元测试通过'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'覆盖率未下降'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  manual: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'至少一位 reviewer approve'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'架构变更经过设计讨论'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'文档已更新（如需要）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'变更描述清晰'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Branch Protection Rules</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"required_status_checks:&#10;  strict: true&#10;  contexts:&#10;    - &#39;lint&#39;&#10;    - &#39;typecheck&#39;&#10;    - &#39;test&#39;&#10;required_pull_request_reviews:&#10;  required_approving_review_count: 1&#10;  dismiss_stale_reviews: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">required_status_checks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  strict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contexts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lint'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'typecheck'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">required_pull_request_reviews</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  required_approving_review_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  dismiss_stale_reviews</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>设置</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Required checks</td>\n<td>lint + typecheck + test</td>\n<td>确保自动化检查通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Required reviews</td>\n<td>≥1 approval</td>\n<td>确保人工审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dismiss stale reviews</td>\n<td>true</td>\n<td>代码变更后需要重新审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Up-to-date branches</td>\n<td>strict</td>\n<td>确保与目标分支同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((审查自动化))&#10;    工具层&#10;      Danger.js&#10;      GitHub Actions&#10;      PR Bot 评论&#10;    自动化范围&#10;      格式化检查&#10;      Lint 检查&#10;      安全扫描&#10;      覆盖率门禁&#10;    自动修复&#10;      Bot 提交格式修复&#10;      仅安全修复&#10;      风险控制&#10;    质量追踪&#10;      指标收集&#10;      趋势分析&#10;      团队仪表盘&#10;    流程设计&#10;      自动化 + 人工互补&#10;      Branch Protection&#10;      Pre-merge 清单\">mindmap\n  root((审查自动化))\n    工具层\n      Danger.js\n      GitHub Actions\n      PR Bot 评论\n    自动化范围\n      格式化检查\n      Lint 检查\n      安全扫描\n      覆盖率门禁\n    自动修复\n      Bot 提交格式修复\n      仅安全修复\n      风险控制\n    质量追踪\n      指标收集\n      趋势分析\n      团队仪表盘\n    流程设计\n      自动化 + 人工互补\n      Branch Protection\n      Pre-merge 清单</pre><ul>\n<li>代码审查自动化的目标是消除低价值的机械检查，让人工审查聚焦于架构和业务逻辑</li>\n<li>Danger.js 提供了可编程的 PR 审查框架，支持自定义检查规则和评论</li>\n<li>自动修复 + Bot 提交可以实现零摩擦的格式化，但需要限制为确定安全的修复</li>\n<li>代码质量指标的长期追踪有助于发现退化趋势和指导改进方向</li>\n<li>Branch Protection Rules 确保自动化检查和人工审查都不可绕过</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码审查自动化","id":"代码审查自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub PR 自动化工具","id":"github-pr-自动化工具"},{"level":2,"text":"自动修复与 Bot 提交","id":"自动修复与-bot-提交"},{"level":2,"text":"代码质量仪表盘","id":"代码质量仪表盘"},{"level":2,"text":"审查流程最佳实践","id":"审查流程最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Monorepo 中的 Lint 策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/team-ci-integration/monorepo-lint-strategy"},"next":null}